 "_supersededComment": [
  "Pages replaced during the 2026-08-15 rebuild when the roster moved from initials",
  "(derived from email addresses) to full names from the board export. Joseph chose to",
  "leave them live. They are recorded so a future run never reuses or resurrects them,",
  "and so work/LINKS.md can warn against sending them."
 ],
 "_manualPageComment": [
  "manualPage: true on a rep means their page is NOT generated. build_rep_pages.py skips them and",
  "says so in its summary, so a weekly run can never publish a template page over hand-written",
  "content. Jacob Diaz is the case that forced this: his page also carries files from the PA FILES",
  "and John Wynn boards, which the board-driven build cannot see."
 ]
